Third-party components

This mod contains no code or assets from Battle Brothers, which remains the
property of Overhype Studios.

It requires, and is distributed with, two third-party mods that keep their own
licenses and copyright:

  - Modern Hooks -- https://www.nexusmods.com/battlebrothers/mods/685
  - MSU          -- https://github.com/MSUTeam/MSU

Speech reaches the screen reader through Tolk, by Davy Kager
(https://github.com/dkager/tolk), and nvdaControllerClient64.dll, by NV Access
(https://www.nvaccess.org). Both are redistributed unmodified, under their own
licenses.
